// Contract between sky-camera devices and the ingest service.
//
// Design notes live in GO_GRPC_AND_POSTGRES.md. The short version:
//   - DeviceSession is the long-lived control plane (small messages, both ways).
//   - UploadFrame is the data plane: one call per frame, FITS sent in chunks.
//     Frames are NOT sent on DeviceSession, because messages within one stream
//     are ordered and a 25MB frame would block commands queued behind it.
//   - Uploads are resumable: GetUploadStatus says how many FITS bytes are
